5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must learn from the past. I propose we examine the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts to understand what truly endures.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should also check the capital budget and software allowance. It’s important to know what we can actually afford.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, let’s peek at the misrouted deliveries! I bet the incident logs hold a super fun mystery about where things went wrong.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I suggest reviewing the time lost to copying existing records. We need to quantify the actual operational drag before judging any new proposal.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I propose we examine in-house developer availability. We cannot assume capacity exists without verifying who is actually free to take on new work.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your caution is wise. Yet, knowing the budget is only half the story. We must also understand the human cost of our current inefficiencies.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. The budget is just the start. I’m worried about hidden costs later.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, checking who’s free is super important! I’m scared we’ll promise dates when nobody’s actually ready to build.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, your concern is valid. However, we must also verify if the proposed solution actually addresses the root cause of the misrouted deliveries.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, quantifying drag is useful, but it ignores the people absorbing it. We need to know who is actually available before promising anything.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your curiosity is refreshing. Yet, let us not chase ghosts. We must ground our choices in the reality of our current resources and past lessons.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I’m still worried about the renewal notice. The real bill often arrives next year, not now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
