35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the pattern is clear. Broad mandates fade, but narrow, trade-specific tools endure. We must build for the specific, not the general.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I found the capital line is frozen. But the software allowance has room. We must avoid per-head licences that climb with every department added.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
